msgid "A system update is ready. Restart the computer to finish installing it."
msgstr "En Systemupdate is praat. Start den Reekner nee, üm dat Installeren aftosluten."

msgid "System files need repair. This happens automatically the next time the computer restarts."
msgstr "Systemdateien mööt repareert warrn. Dat passeert automaatsch, wenn de Reekner dat nächste Maal nee start."

msgid "The web browser is not installed yet."
msgstr "De Webbrowser is noch nich installeert."

msgid "The web browser is ready. Sign out and sign in again to see it."
msgstr "De Webbrowser is praat. Mell di af un weer an, üm em to sehn."

msgid "This app is not available on this device"
msgstr "Disse App is op dissem Reedschap nich verfögbar"

msgid "This app's lock settings are not in effect, so it cannot start. Please ask your teacher."
msgstr "De Sperr-Instellens vun disse App gellt nich, dorüm kann se nich starten. Fraag bitte dien Lehrer."

msgid "Could not end your session. Please sign out and open this app from the sign-in screen."
msgstr "Dien Törn kunn nich beendt warrn. Mell di bitte af un maak disse App vun den Anmell-Billschirm op."

msgid "This will end your session and open %s in locked mode."
msgstr "Dat beendt dien Törn un maakt %s in'n sperrten Modus op."

msgid "Newer settings could not be fetched. Please contact IT."
msgstr "Nieger Instellens kunnen nich haalt warrn. Mell di bitte bi de IT."

msgid "Settings have not been confirmed up to date for %s days. Please connect to the network; if this persists, contact IT."
msgstr "Siet %s Daag is nich bestätigt, dat de Instellens aktuell sünd. Verbinn di bitte mit dat Nettwark; wenn dat so blifft, mell di bi de IT."

msgid "IT is collecting diagnostic info from this computer."
msgstr "IT sammelt Diagnose-Infos vun dissen Reekner."
